      "id": "claim_53e327db462441d0ad538f156068f172",
      "statement": "The shipped release profile trades size and safety margins (fat LTO, codegen-units 1, opt-level s, panic=abort, strip), while the lab profile keeps release optimization but swaps fat LTO for thin LTO with 16 codegen units, incremental compilation, and symbols (strip=false, debug=line-tables-only) so perf attributes CPU; the shipped artifact stays on release.",
