      "statement": "Architecture boundaries are enforced by lints: clippy.toml forbids ambient tokio/task/time, ambient clocks, rand::random, process id, and std::fs inside the execution domain with reasons naming asyncrt replacements; celld forbids disallowed macros and warns disallowed methods/types, and the ltx crate enables the same warnings.",
